        You cannot buy a ticket on the day — the Palace Museum sells out 7 days ahead, and in peak season (Apr 1–Oct 31) tickets are <strong>¥60</strong> (¥40 off-season). Book online through the <strong>official Palace Museum website</strong> (foreigners register with their passport and pay by international card — no Chinese payment app required). The museum is closed every Monday (except public holidays). Book at <strong>8 pm Beijing time, exactly 7 days before your visit</strong> — Golden Week slots disappear within minutes.
